Action Input: {"smiles": "CC(C)C1=C2C=C(C=CC2=NC=C1)C(=O)O", "top_k": 1}

Thought: The search result for the SMILES "CC(C)C1=C2C=C(C=CC2=NC=C1)C(=O)O" also does not match the proton NMR data we have. I will continue to check the next isomer in the list to find a match with the proton NMR data.
